print "[#ffd166]快速响应多供一[] v27 · 31 槽单位多控"
print "By - [blue]Ili[#8abcd1]ary[#654321]艾铭[#ffb6c1]✽[] & DeepSeek"
print "N=8 一圈 155 条 = 1.29 s（micro 2 ipt）；单位交互冷却 1.5 s"
print "相对派发：@counter 自校准，增删头部不用改数字；核心 3 s 节流"
set N 8
ubind @poly
sensor cfg.utype @unit @type
jump 5 strictEqual cfg.utype null
op mul cfg.cap N 2
op add cfg.cap cfg.cap 4
set cfg.next 0
set cfg.nloc 0
set sx @thisx
set sy @thisy
set lx @thisx
set ly @thisy
op min N N 31
op max N N 1
op mul tmp.hp N -19
op sub tmp.hp tmp.hp 3
